<title>ITALY: Italian refinery runs rose 0.4 pct in 1996 - UP.</title>
<headline>Italian refinery runs rose 0.4 pct in 1996 - UP.</headline>
<dateline>ROME 1997-02-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Italian refinery runs rose 0.4 percent to 88.3 million tonnes in 1996, trade body Unione Petrolifera said in a statement on Thursday.</p>
<p>It said crude refinery runs rose 2.1 percent over this period while imported semi-finished products fell 14.8 percent.</p>
<p>-- Rome newsroom +396 6782501</p>
</text>
